# Local pool of 2026-11-25 (milestone M6): the two missing seeds (45, 46) of the 100k designs, so the
# 100k-vs-300k budget comparison and the final-design choice both rest on five seeds; validation years only.
# - pit_plan_weekly_lstm_shared at 100k (seeds 42-44 are in pit_walk_forward_shared_20261110);
# - a rerun of fold 2016 seed 42 at 100k, to check that retraining reproduces the 2026-11-10 model;
# - five-stock A2C at 100k (seeds 42-44 are in algorithm_comparison_20261106).
# Run from the repository root with run dirs beside it (~/drl_runs): scripts/run_task_pool.sh slurm/pools/local_20261125.tasks 3
